{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9b1c2969-9e7b-8889-86ff-1c83442ccbc8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:19:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. Hello. My name is Kevin Sullivan. I have a question about a tree. A big limb, it is down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Sullivan, I can help with that. Where is the limb? Is it on your property or on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is on the sidewalk. In front of the house. The limb is very big, it come down after the storm. The one from Friday into Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:08:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The coastal storm, okay. So it's been about three days. Is it blocking the sidewalk completely?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:08:45-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the people, they must walk in the street to pass. [line breaks up] ... you hear me? Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second there. You said people have to walk in the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Yes, in the street. The signal is not good in my phone. I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:09:23-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I'll repeat things back so we get it right. A large limb is down across the sidewalk and people are walking out into the road. Is it touching any wires?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires. I look. The limb is on the ground. It is not on the wire. The wire is up, high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's important. If a wire ever is down or touching a limb, you stay away and call the utility and 911. But if it's just on the ground, we can take the report. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two sixteen Gibbs Avenue. Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two sixteen Gibbs Avenue. Got it. And is the tree itself on the city's side, like out by the curb, or is it back in the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I want to ask you this. Who I must call? The city, or the owner, or the electric company? I am not sure who do this work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 35,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's the right question. It depends where the tree stands. If it's a street tree, out in the strip between the sidewalk and the road, that's the city. If it grew in the yard, it's the property owner's. The electric company only handles it if it's in the wires."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, one more time. City for the street tree. Owner for the yard tree. Electric company for the wire."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent the house. I am not the owner. So if it is in the yard, I call my landlord?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, you'd let your landlord know. But first let's figure out which kind of tree it is. Can you see where the trunk is? Is it in the grass by the sidewalk, or inside the fence or the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tree is by the sidewalk. Between the sidewalk and the road, I think. It is a little bit of grass there. The trunk is in the grass."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that sounds like a street tree. Then that would be us. I can put in a request for a crew to come look at it and clear the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:13:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:13:32-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, one moment. A phone is ringing in the house. It is the other phone. [pause] Nobody is here to answer. It is okay. It will stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'm writing this down. Can you tell me about how big the limb is? Like how long, how thick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:14:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is long, maybe, um, as long as a car. And thick like this, my leg. [crosstalk] The phone is ringing again, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. So about the length of a car, as thick as your leg. Is it still attached to the tree at all, or is it all the way on the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is on the ground. But the tree, there is a place on top where it break. I think maybe another piece can fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:15:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that there may be a hanging or broken piece still up in the tree. That helps the crew know what to bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Please write that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:15:26-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Now, so I can get this to the right people, can you give me a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:15:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one nine one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine one. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And your name again, Sullivan, S-U-L-L-I-V-A-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Kevin Sullivan. Two L, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:15-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So I have Kevin Sullivan, two sixteen Gibbs Avenue, a large limb across the sidewalk from the storm last weekend, possibly a street tree, and a broken piece that may still be up in the tree. No wires involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is all correct. Thank you for repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 35,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. I should tell you that crews are still working through a lot of storm calls, so I can't say the exact day they'll get there. But this goes in the queue, and a limb across a sidewalk with people walking in the road is something they'll want to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Maybe one day, two day, three day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:17:32-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I really can't tell you which day. It could be a few days. If it gets worse, or the other piece comes down, or it ends up in the road, call back and we'll update the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. If it is worse, I call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:18:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And if anything touches a wire, don't go near it. Call the electric company and 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:18:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I stay away. [line breaks up] Hello? Hello, you are there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:18:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here. You cut out for a second. I was saying, if a wire gets involved, stay back and call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Stay back. Call nine one one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:18:49-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And since you rent, it might be a good idea to tell your landlord what's happened, just so they know. But the city will look at the tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I tell the landlord today. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there anything else I can help with, Mr. Sullivan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:19:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care."
    }
  ],
